 <h3><u>Midhat e sakina</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Sakina.. sakina.. sakina... sakina..(2)<br> Jaise ke bayaa'n ho nahi sakta<br> do lafzo mein qur'aan sakina<br> sakina.. sakina<br> midhat hai kaha'n aapki asaan sakina..(2)<br> kaise mai likhu dusra qur'aan sakina<br> midhat hai kaha'n aapki asaan sakina<br> midhat hai kaha'n aapki asaan sakina..(2)</p> 
  <p>1. Shabbir ke hoto'n pe hai bibi teri midhat..(2)<br> ya lab pe hai qur'an ke qur'an sakina<br> midhat hai kaha'n aapki asaan sakina..(2)</p> 
  <p>2. Ek samt hai shabbir to ek samt hai abbas..(2)<br> gehware ki tere hai ajab shaan sakina<br> midhat hai kaha'n aapki asaan sakina..(2)</p> 
  <p>3. Qur'aan e taharat mein ho tum sura e kausar..(2)<br> is par hai mukammal mera eemaan sakina<br> midhat hai kaha'n aapki asaan sakina..(2)</p> 
  <p>4. Parcham to bohot aur bhi duniya mein hai lekin..(2)<br> hai parcham e abbas ki pehchan sakina<br> midhat hai kaha'n aapki asaan sakina..(2)</p> 
  <p>5. Shabbir ye kehte ho ke tum jisme nahi ho..(2)<br> ghar aisa nazar aata hai veeran sakina<br> midhat hai kaha'n aapki asaan sakina..(2)</p> 
  <p>6. Us shakhs ka rutba koi abbas se puche..(2)<br> jo hai tere darbaar ka darbaan sakina<br> midhat hai kaha'n aapki asaan sakina..(2)</p> 
  <p>7. Jab shaam ke darbaar mein hoti hai azaanein..(2)<br> hota hai teri jeet ka ailaan sakina<br> midhat hai kaha'n aapki asaan sakina..(2)</p> 
  <p>8. Is khwaab ki tabeer dikha de mujhe bibi..(2)<br> mai phir se hua hu tera mehmaan sakina<br> midhat hai kaha'n aapki asaan sakina..(2)</p> 
  <p>9. Dil mein hai mere ek hi armaan sakina..(2)<br> nikle tere rauze pe meri jaan sakina<br> midhat hai kaha'n aapki asaan sakina..(2)</p> 
  <p>10. Sab kuch mai luta deta hu shabbir pe phir bhi..(2)<br> hone nahi deti mera nuksaan sakina<br> midhat hai kaha'n aapki asaan sakina..(2)</p> 
  <p>11. Ash'har ne kaha badh gayi tauqeer teri aur..(2)<br> beti ka rakha naam jo 'farhan' sakina<br> midhat hai kaha'n aapki asaan sakina..(2)<br> Sakina.. sakina.. sakina... sakina</p> 
